[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3344257789","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3344257789","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3344257789,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HVVL9","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-28T21:09:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T21:09:17Z","body":"What's the origin of this button? When was it added?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3344257789/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3344265417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3344265417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3344265417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HVXDJ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-28T21:18:55Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T21:18:55Z","body":"It was added in #19837, so when the dialog was added.\r\n\r\nAlthough now I realized it _might_ serve a rather niche feature that not many know (probaby): when you add a `class_name` script in addon's folder, the addon needs to be active for the class to be visible. It's funny, because you still need an EditorPlugin script (even empty) to activate an addon, so the feature is awkward to use. But yeah, if you want to add a toggleable global class, it's useful that the addon is active immediately (even though you can just click the checkbox I guess xd). I wonder if anyone even uses this feature.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3344265417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3345269891","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3345269891","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3345269891,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HZMSD","user":{"login":"KerekesDavid","id":9087461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODc0NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9087461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid","html_url":"https://github.com/KerekesDavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T06:52:53Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T07:01:32Z","body":"I'd probably expect my newly created addon to be enabled by default, reload the project to see the changes I made (that's what I do instead of enabling/disabling the addon usually, it's one less menu/click, and it has more consistent behaviour in general), and wonder why it's not working after this change.\r\n\r\nBut I do not create that many new plugins tbh. 😅","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3345269891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3347439124","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3347439124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3347439124,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hhd4U","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T14:51:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T14:51:51Z","body":"> reload the project to see the changes I made (that's what I do instead of enabling/disabling the addon usually, it's one less menu/click, and it has more consistent behaviour in general)\r\n\r\nReloading the project takes much longer though, I don't get why would anyone prefer it .-.\r\nThe easiest way to reload a plugin (assuming you do it quite often, which is usually the case) is using some plugin refresher addon.  The default ways are less efficient. Toggling the plugin manually involves opening the dialog and clicking checkbox, and editor restart just takes (relatively) long time, especially if the addon is part of a bigger project.\r\n\r\nYou are the second person to mention this workflow though, if there is more people that prefer restarting editor, I guess another solution is making the checkbox disabled by default and adding a warning/info about intended usage.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3347439124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3350934247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3350934247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3350934247,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HuzLn","user":{"login":"KerekesDavid","id":9087461,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwODc0NjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9087461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid","html_url":"https://github.com/KerekesDavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KerekesDavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T09:28:06Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T09:32:48Z","body":"> Reloading the project takes much longer though, I don't get why would anyone prefer it .-. \r\n\r\nMy plugin is in it's own project with nothing but a scene containing a test script, so reloading isn't that much slower than opening the extra menu 😅\r\n\r\nBugs in tool scripts have a tendency to leave the editor in a weird state, so I prefer to start from a clean slate. Otherwise I end up debugging phantom issues a bit too often.\r\n\r\nBut I really don't want to bikeshed this issue, just explaining my usual workflow. For me personally, deleting the enable checkbox would cause maybe 3 minutes of confusion every half a year in the worst case 😂 If it saves anyone more time than that, then I think it's worth it to remove it. It also cleans up the interface a bit, so it makes sense.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3350934247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351224594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3351224594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3351224594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hv6ES","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T10:29:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T10:29:49Z","body":"IMO what needs to be addressed is the UX issue of reloading plugins in the first place.\r\n\r\nTo me it makes sense that when you create a new plugin, it should be enabled. The UX of having to go through the project settings to enable a plugin you just created is cumbersome (it's also cumbersome when you have to update a plugin you just installed, but that's a separate issue).\r\n\r\nCould we have a menu entry like \"Reload Plugins\" like we have \"Reload Scene\"?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351224594/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351337706","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3351337706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3351337706,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HwVrq","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-30T10:49:53Z","updated_at":"2025-09-30T11:04:18Z","body":"I can make a proposal about reloading, but it does not solve the problem with errors if the plugin is activated immediately. Although it's not a big deal, and you will likely get errors at some point anyway, so whatever.\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13308","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3351337706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366884670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3366884670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3366884670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IrpU-","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T19:06:01Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T19:06:01Z","body":"The [documentation states](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/editor/making_plugins.html#creating-a-plugin):\r\n> Unchecking the `Activate now?` option in C# is always required because, like every other C# script, the EditorPlugin script needs to be compiled which requires building the project. After building the project the plugin can be enabled in the `Plugins` tab of `Project Settings`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366884670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3366890478","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111012#issuecomment-3366890478","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111012","id":3366890478,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Irqvu","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-03T19:08:06Z","updated_at":"2025-10-03T19:08:06Z","body":"Yeah, the button is disabled when trying to create C# plugin.","author_assoc